{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":98,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܙܡܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܙܡܵܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܚܲܕܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܕܘܼܡܵܪܹ̈ܐ ܥܒ݂ܝܼܕ ܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܒ݂ܝܼܕ ܠܵܗ̇ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܵܐ ܐܸܠܹܗ ܝܲܡܝܼܢܹܗ ܘܕܪܲܥܢܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܕܸܥ ܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܕܡ ܥܲܝ̈ܢܹܐ ܕܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܓܠܹܐ ܠܹܗ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܟ݂ܝܼܪܹܗ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܹܗ ܘܡܗܘܼܡܢܘܼܬܹܗ ܠܒܹܝܬ ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܙܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡܲܪ̈ܙܵܢܹܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܵܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܘܸܚܘܼܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܠܵܗ̇ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܨܘܿܚܘܼܢ ܘܫܲܒܚܘܼܢ ܘܙܡܘܿܪܘܼܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܙܡܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܟܸܢܵܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܟܸܢܵܪܵܐ ܘܩܵܠܵܐ ܕܙܡܵܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܢܲܦܝܼܪܹ̈ܐ ܘܩܵܠܵܐ ܕܫܝܼܦܘܿܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܘܸܚܘܼܢ ܩܲܕܡ ܡܲܠܟܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܲܪܒܸܪܵܐ ܝܵܡܵܐ ܘܡܸܠܝܘܼܬܘܼܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܹܒܹܝܠܔ ܘܥܵܡܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܕܓܵܘܘܼܗ̇.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܲܗܪ̈ܵܘܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܡܵܚܝܼ ܟ̰ܲܦܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܩܲܘܸܚܝܼ ܥܲܡ ܚܕܵܕܹ̈ܐ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܕܡ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܣܵܒܵܒ ܒܹܐܬܵܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܠܸܕܝܵܢܵܐ ܠܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܕܵܐܹܢ ܬܹܒܹܝܠܔ ܒܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ ܒܬܪܘܼܨܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/98.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/99.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/97.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}